==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
In {{BotW}}, Bokoblin Guts are [[Material]]s that are dropped by defeated [[Blue Bokoblin]]s, [[Black Bokoblin]]s, and [[Silver Bokoblin]]s, as well as by [[Golden Bokoblin]]s in [[Master Mode]]. They are also available to purchase at [[High Spirits Produce]] in [[Kakariko Village]]. They convulse on their own occasionally.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Bokoblin Guts can be used with other ingredients to [[Cooking|Cook]] [[Elixir]]s. At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], they can also be used to make [[Purple Dye]], or they can be sold to [[Kilton]] at [[Fang and Bone]] for [[Mon]].

Bokoblin Guts are required to [[Enhancing|Enhance]] the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|BotW|Bokoblin Guts}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
Bokoblin Guts can be dropped by [[Blue Bokoblin]]s, [[Black Bokoblin]]s, and [[Silver Bokoblin]]s upon their defeat.

Bokoblin Guts are required to [[Enhancing|Enhance]] the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|TotK|Bokoblin Guts}}

